---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---
<Layout title="About — Westport, Unfiltered">
  <section class="wrap" style="padding: 40px 0; max-width: 640px;">
    <h1 style="font-size:26px; margin-bottom:16px;">About</h1>
    <p style="font-size:14px; line-height:1.7; color: var(--color-ink-soft); margin-bottom:24px;">
      We're Brett & Hela, and we've lived in Westport for [X years]. This started as a running argument
      over dinner about where to eat next, and turned into a habit of writing it down. Every place on
      this site has been eaten at by both of us — no sponsored visits, no press-release copy, just our
      honest take.    
    </p>

    <h2 id="ratings" style="font-size:18px; margin-bottom:10px;">How we rate</h2>
    <p style="font-size:14px; line-height:1.7; color: var(--color-ink-soft);">
      The numbers here aren't averages, and they're not crowd-sourced — they're ours. We rate together
      after every meal, weighing food, service, and vibe as a whole rather than scoring each separately,
      the same way you'd actually decide where to eat. An 8 means we'd go back without thinking twice.
      A 6 means it's fine, but we wouldn't rearrange our week for it.
    </p>
  </section>
</Layout>
